  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Aura</strong> faint Destruction; <strong>CL</strong> 5th<br>\n<strong>Slot</strong> none; <strong>Price</strong> 625 gp; <strong>Weight</strong> -</p>\n<p><strong>Description</strong><br>\nThis scroll creates a frost blast, dealing 5d6 cold damage to everything within a 15-foot radius burst centered within close range. A successful Reflex save halves the damage. Targets who fail their save are also staggered for 1 round.</p>\n<p><strong>Construction Requirements</strong><br>\nCapture Spell, Destruction sphere (Frost Blast (blast type, cold)); <strong>Cost</strong> 312.5 gp</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/scrolls#toc5\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
